==Battleground==
*5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
*8 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Darks]] such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and you should win. The 20% [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] will not be a big problem.

